	<item>
		<title>Nandewar Weekender Lamb Box</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/nandewar-weekender-lamb-box/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/nandewar-weekender-lamb-box/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 04 Aug 2024 01:28:34 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=10212</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<div class="product__description rte quick-add-hidden">
<p>Our Weekender BBQ box includes 6kg of delicious cuts chosen for their versatility on the BBQ and in the Smoker.</p>
<ul>
<li>Shoulder Chops (great for BBQing &#38; marinating)</li>
<li>1 x Half Roast</li>
<li>Mince</li>
<li>Sausages</li>
<li>Spare Ribs</li>
<li>Rack</li>
</ul>
<p>Hogget refers to sheep between one and two years old; it's a little older than lamb, offering a fuller flavour with slightly firmer meat.</p>
<p><em>Please note: images shown are for illustration of what is included in the box, they show Lamb products, but this product is Hogget and you will receive Hogget by purchasing this product.</em></p>
</div>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/nandewar-weekender-lamb-box/">Nandewar Weekender Lamb Box</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/nandewar-weekender-lamb-box/">Nandewar Weekender Lamb Box</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/nandewar-weekender-lamb-box/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
